SUMMARY:Desi Banks: Your Favorite Cousin Tour LIVE at Raleigh Improv
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nDesi Banks is the ultimate triple threat — actor\, stand-up comedian\, content creator\, and entrepreneur who is taking the entertainment world by storm. With over 19 million fans across social media platforms\, Desi has built one of the most loyal and engaged audiences in comedy today\, and his live shows are a direct reflection of that energy. \nIn 2024\, Desi embarked on his own 50-city headline tour\, selling nearly 52\,000 tickets. He has toured alongside heavyweights like Mike Epps\, Deray Davis\, Kountry Wayne\, Gary Owen\, and Lavell Crawford\, and joined Martin Lawrence on the “Y’all Know What It Is!” tour in Las Vegas\, Los Angeles\, and Oakland. Kevin Hart has publicly praised Desi as the “next great” talent in comedy. \nAs an actor\, Desi has appeared in major motion pictures including Lawrence Lamont’s One of Them Days (produced by Issa Rae\, starring Keke Palmer and SZA)\, Will Packer’s Little\, and the indie-horror film Haunted Trail on BET+. He is also the CEO and founder of Desi Banks Productions\, a creative powerhouse that has produced over 3\,500 original videos and partnered with brands including Meta\, Apple\, Beats by Dre\, and PrizePicks. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, July 24\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM EDT (Doors open at 5:30 PM)\nVenue: Raleigh Improv\nAddress: 1224 Parkside Main St\, Cary\, NC 27519\nAge Restriction: 21+ (valid ID required)\nNote: Two-item minimum purchase required in the showroom for all guests. \nAbout the Venue\nThe Raleigh Improv is the Triangle area’s premier comedy club\, located in the heart of Cary’s Parkside Town Commons. Part of the nationally recognized Improv comedy club chain\, the Raleigh Improv offers an intimate\, club-style atmosphere where every seat feels close to the stage. \nThe venue features general admission seating (first-come\, first-served) as well as premium booth options that include a $200 food and beverage credit. The full-service bar and kitchen menu make it easy to enjoy dinner and drinks before and during the show. \nParking is available in the surrounding Parkside Town Commons shopping center lots. The venue is easily accessible from I-40 and US-1\, making it convenient for guests coming from Raleigh\, Durham\, Chapel Hill\, and surrounding areas. \nWhat to Expect\nDesi Banks delivers a high-energy\, crowd-pleasing stand-up performance packed with razor-sharp wit\, hilarious personal stories\, and the kind of infectious comedic timing that has made him one of the fastest-rising stars in the game. His Your Favorite Cousin Tour is a celebration of the relatable\, real-life humor that his millions of fans have come to love. \nThis is a 21+ event with a lively Friday night crowd. Arrive early to secure your preferred seats\, order from the full menu\, and get ready for an unforgettable night of live comedy. VIP ticket options are available for a premium viewing experience. \nNo cell phone use\, photography\, or video recording is permitted during the performance. All sales are final. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $30 – $95 (plus fees)\nTickets are available through Ticketmaster (official) and VividSeats (resale). \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/desi-banks-your-favorite-cousin-tour-live-at-raleigh-improv/
LOCATION:Raleigh Improv\, 1224 Parkside Main St\, Cary\, NC\, 27519\, United States Of America
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://i.ticketweb.com/i/00/12/76/30/84_Edp.jpg?v=5
GEO:35.8490976;-78.8909556
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Raleigh Improv 1224 Parkside Main St Cary NC 27519 United States Of America;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=1224 Parkside Main St:geo:-78.8909556,35.8490976
END:VEVENT
