SUMMARY:Jess Hilarious LIVE at Chicago Improv
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nJess Hilarious LIVE at Chicago Improv\nJess Hilarious brings her explosive stand-up comedy to the Chicago Improv in Schaumburg for a night of non-stop laughs. Known for her wild energy and razor-sharp wit\, Jess delivers a show that will have you in stitches from start to finish. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, July 24\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM\nVenue: Chicago Improv\nAddress: 5 Woodfield Mall K120B\, Schaumburg\, IL 60173\nAge Requirement: 21+ (Valid ID required)\nSeating: General Admission (first-come\, first-served)\nMinimum: 2-item food/drink minimum per person \nAbout Jess Hilarious\nJess Hilarious is a comedian\, actress\, and media personality best known for her viral social media presence and her role on Wild ‘N Out. She has appeared on The Breakfast Club and numerous comedy specials\, building a massive fanbase with her unfiltered\, high-energy comedic style. Her stand-up shows are known for being raw\, relatable\, and absolutely hilarious. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHigh-energy stand-up from one of comedy’s hottest rising stars\nUnfiltered\, relatable humor that keeps the crowd roaring\nIntimate comedy club atmosphere at Chicago Improv\nFull food and drink service (2-item minimum)\n21+ event — valid photo ID required\nGeneral admission seating — arrive early for best seats\n\nVenue Information\nChicago Improv is located inside Woodfield Mall in Schaumburg\, IL\, one of the premier comedy clubs in the Chicago area. The venue offers a full menu and bar service in an intimate showroom setting perfect for live comedy. \nTicket Information\nTickets range from $46.19 to $65.73. Available through Ticketmaster and VividSeats. Ticket resale is strictly prohibited by the venue. All sales are final. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you.\nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/jess-hilarious-live-at-chicago-improv/
LOCATION:Chicago Improv\, 5 Woodfield Mall\, Schaumburg\, IL\, 60173\, USA
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://s1.ticketm.net/dam/a/bab/90b52ca2-47bd-4bdb-8981-4eec81d35bab_TABLET_LANDSCAPE_LARGE_16_9.jpg
