SUMMARY:Bruce Bruce LIVE at Addison Improv
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nBruce Bruce LIVE at Addison Improv\nOne of stand-up comedy’s most beloved performers is coming to Dallas! Bruce Bruce\, the larger-than-life comedian known for his explosive energy and hilarious storytelling\, brings his “Cool Since Day One” tour to Addison Improv on July 24\, 2026. Get ready for a night of non-stop laughs with one of the funniest men in comedy! \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, July 24\, 2026\nTime: 7:30 PM (Doors open at 6:30 PM)\nVenue: Addison Improv\nAddress: 4980 Belt Line Road #250\, Addison (Dallas)\, TX 75254\nAge Requirement: 18+\nBeverage Minimum: 2-item food or beverage minimum per person \nAbout Bruce Bruce\nBruce Bruce is a stand-up comedian and actor best known for his appearances on Comic View\, Last Comic Standing\, and Who’s Got Jokes?. With his booming voice\, infectious laugh\, and larger-than-life personality\, Bruce has become one of the most recognizable faces in comedy. He has headlined clubs and theaters across the country and continues to pack houses wherever he performs. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHigh-energy stand-up comedy from a true comedy legend\nHilarious storytelling and crowd interaction\nAn intimate comedy club experience at Addison Improv\nNon-stop laughs from start to finish\nFull bar and food service available\n\nVenue Information\nAddison Improv is located at 4980 Belt Line Road #250 in Addison (Dallas)\, TX\, on the second floor at the southwest corner of Belt Line Road and Quorum Drive. This premier comedy club offers an intimate setting with full food and bar service. \nTicket Information\nTickets start at approximately $50 and are available now. This is an 18+ event with a 2-item food or beverage minimum per person. Grab your seats before they sell out! \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/bruce-bruce-live-at-addison-improv/
LOCATION:Addison Improv\, 4980 Belt Line Road #250\, Dallas\, TX\, 75254\, United States Of America
