SUMMARY:Dylan Carlino: If I Was A Girl Tour LIVE at Cobb's Comedy Club
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nDylan Carlino: If I Was A Girl Tour LIVE at Cobb’s Comedy Club\nDylan Carlino is bringing his massively popular If I Was A Girl tour to Cobb’s Comedy Club in San Francisco for a special night of stand-up comedy. Known for his viral online sketches that have racked up over 100 million views\, Dylan delivers sharp\, relatable humor that has made him one of the fastest-rising comedians in the country. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, July 24\, 2026\nTime: 7:30 PM PDT (Doors open at 6:30 PM)\nVenue: Cobb’s Comedy Club\nAddress: 915 Columbus Avenue\, San Francisco\, CA 94133\nAge Requirement: 18+ (Valid photo ID required)\nBeverage Minimum: Two-drink minimum per person \nAbout Dylan Carlino\nDylan Carlino is a comedian and content creator best known for his viral “If I Was a Girl…” series\, which has amassed over 100 million views across social media platforms. His sharp observational humor and relatable storytelling have earned him a massive following and a reputation as one of comedy’s most exciting emerging voices. He has performed at clubs and theaters across the country\, building a loyal fanbase with his energetic and authentic style. \nWhat to Expect\n\nA full evening of stand-up comedy featuring Dylan Carlino’s signature viral humor\nMaterial from his popular “If I Was A Girl” series and beyond\nAn intimate club setting at the legendary Cobb’s Comedy Club\nDoors open one hour before showtime — arrive early for the best seats\nFull bar service with a two-drink minimum per person\nAn unforgettable night of laughs in San Francisco’s North Beach neighborhood\n\nVenue Information\nCobb’s Comedy Club is one of San Francisco’s premier comedy venues\, located at 915 Columbus Avenue in the vibrant North Beach neighborhood. The club has hosted some of the biggest names in comedy and offers an intimate atmosphere with excellent sightlines from every seat. Street parking is available nearby\, and the venue is accessible via public transit. \nTicket Information\nTickets start from $46 and are available through Ticketmaster (official) or VividSeats (resale marketplace). Ticket prices may vary based on availability. All sales are final — no refunds or exchanges unless the event is cancelled or postponed. \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/dylan-carlino-if-i-was-a-girl-tour-live-at-cobbs-comedy-club/
LOCATION:Cobb’s Comedy Club\, 915 Columbus Avenue\, San Francisco\, California\, 94133\, United States Of America
