SUMMARY:Jeff Dunham: Artificial Intelligence LIVE at Emerald Queen Casino
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nJeff Dunham: Artificial Intelligence LIVE at Emerald Queen Casino\nComedy superstar Jeff Dunham is bringing his record-breaking Artificial Intelligence tour to the Emerald Queen Casino Event Center in Tacoma\, WA. Known for his hilarious cast of puppet characters\, Dunham delivers a one-of-a-kind comedy experience that has made him one of the best-selling stand-up comedians of all time. Don’t miss this unforgettable night of laughs on July 24\, 2026! \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, July 24\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM (Doors open at 7:00 PM)\nVenue: Emerald Queen Casino Event Center\nAddress: 2920 East R Street\, Tacoma\, WA 98404\nAge Requirement:\nParking: Ample parking available in multiple garages at EQC Tacoma \nAbout Jeff Dunham\nJeff Dunham is one of the most successful stand-up comedians in the world\, known for his unique blend of ventriloquism and comedy. His beloved characters — including Walter\, Peanut\, Achmed the Dead Terrorist\, and Bubba J — have made him a household name. Dunham holds the Guinness World Record for the most tickets sold for a stand-up comedy tour and has sold out arenas across the globe. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHilarious ventriloquism featuring Jeff’s iconic puppet characters\nNew material from the Artificial Intelligence tour\nA world-class comedy performance in an intimate casino event center setting\nFull bar service available (21+ event)\nState-of-the-art sound and lighting at the EQC Event Center\nAn evening of non-stop laughs for comedy fans of all backgrounds\n\nVenue Information\nThe Emerald Queen Casino Event Center is a state-of-the-art event space with stadium seating for 1\,800+ guests\, located at EQC Tacoma — just 20 miles south of SeaTac Airport. The venue features six dining options\, a sports bar\, and ample parking in multiple garages. \nTicket Information\nTickets go on sale to the general public on April 3\, 2026. Artist pre-sale runs April 1–3\, 2026. There is a ticket limit of 8 tickets per person. All sales are final. This is a 21+ event — valid photo ID required for entry. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/jeff-dunham-artificial-intelligence-live-at-emerald-queen-casino/
