SUMMARY:Joe Kilgallon LIVE at CG's Comedy Club
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nJoe Kilgallon LIVE at CG’s Comedy Club\nJoe Kilgallon brings his sharp\, straight-shooting stand-up comedy to CG’s Comedy Club in Bolingbrook for a night of laughs. Described by the Chicago Tribune as having “a straight shooting\, no-nonsense style\,” Kilgallon is a Chicago comedy favorite. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, July 24\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM\nVenue: CG’s Comedy Club\nAddress: 619 E. Boughton Rd.\, Ste. 125\, Bolingbrook\, IL 60440\nAge Requirement: 21+ (Valid ID required)\nPhone: (630) 410-8906 \nAbout Joe Kilgallon\nJoe Kilgallon is a Chicago-based stand-up comedian known for his sharp wit and relatable observational humor. Praised by the Chicago Tribune for his straight-shooting style\, Kilgallon has built a loyal following in the Chicago comedy scene and beyond. His performances are consistently praised for their clever writing and natural stage presence. \nWhat to Expect\n\nSharp\, observational stand-up comedy\nIntimate comedy club setting at CG’s Comedy Club\nFull bar service available\nShow starts at 8:00 PM sharp\n21+ event — valid photo ID required\nGreat night out in the Bolingbrook/Chicago suburbs\n\nVenue Information\nCG’s Comedy Club is located at 619 E. Boughton Rd. in Bolingbrook\, IL\, a popular comedy destination in the Chicago suburbs. The club features a full bar and an intimate showroom atmosphere perfect for live stand-up comedy. \nTicket Information\nTickets are available through Ticketmaster and VividSeats. All shows are 21 and up. Contact the venue at (630) 410-8906 for more information. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you.\nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
