SUMMARY:Melissa Villasenor LIVE at Brea Improv
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout Melissa Villasenor\nMelissa Villasenor is a comedian\, actress\, and impressionist best known as a cast member of Saturday Night Live\, where she made history as the first Latina cast member in the show’s history. A native of Whittier\, California\, Villasenor first gained national attention when she appeared on America’s Got Talent at just 19 years old\, wowing judges with her uncanny celebrity impressions. Her SNL tenure showcased her extraordinary range — from spot-on impressions of Ariana Grande\, Dolly Parton\, and Lana Del Rey to original characters that became fan favorites. Beyond SNL\, she has appeared in films and TV shows and continues to tour as a stand-up comedian\, bringing her unique blend of impressions\, original characters\, and heartfelt storytelling to audiences across the country. \nWhat to Expect\nA Melissa Villasenor show is a delightful mix of celebrity impressions\, original characters\, and personal storytelling. Her comedy is warm\, clever\, and surprisingly vulnerable — she has a gift for finding the funny in everyday moments while also showcasing her extraordinary vocal and physical mimicry. Expect to hear spot-on impressions of pop stars\, actors\, and public figures woven seamlessly into her stand-up set. Her energy is infectious and her stage presence is magnetic. This is a 21+ show at the intimate Brea Improv\, so you’ll be up close and personal with one of comedy’s most versatile performers. \nAbout Brea Improv\nThe Brea Improv is one of Southern California’s premier comedy clubs\, located at 180 S Brea Blvd in Brea\, CA — just 30 miles southeast of downtown Los Angeles. Part of the nationally renowned Improv Comedy Club chain\, the Brea location features an intimate showroom with general admission seating\, premium booths\, and a full food and beverage menu. The club has a mandatory two-item minimum per guest in the showroom\, making it a true dinner-and-a-show experience. With its cozy atmosphere and excellent sightlines\, every seat feels close to the stage. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Saturday\, July 25\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM PDT (Doors open at 5:30 PM)\nVenue: Brea Improv\, 180 S Brea Blvd\, Brea\, CA 92821\nAge Requirement: 21+\nTicket Prices: $35 – $62 (plus fees)\n\nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/melissa-villasenor-live-at-brea-improv/
LOCATION:Brea Improv\, 180 South Brea Blvd\, Brea\, CA\, 92821\, United States
