SUMMARY:Adam Ray LIVE at Wells Hall at The Parker
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets (Ticketmaster) \nResale Tickets (VividSeats) \nAdam Ray LIVE at Wells Hall at The Parker\nComedian Adam Ray brings his “WHO IS ME” tour to Fort Lauderdale for an unforgettable night of comedy. Known for his high-energy performances and relatable humor\, Adam Ray delivers laughs that resonate with audiences of all backgrounds. \nEvent Details\nDate: Saturday\, July 25\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM\nVenue: Wells Hall at The Parker\nAddress: 707 NE 8th Street\, Fort Lauderdale\, FL 33338\nAge Requirement: 18+ \nAbout Adam Ray\nAdam Ray is a talented stand-up comedian known for his engaging storytelling and comedic timing. With years of experience performing across the country\, he has built a loyal fanbase through his authentic and hilarious performances. His “WHO IS ME” tour showcases his best material and comedic evolution. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHigh-energy stand-up comedy performance\nRelatable humor about everyday life\nEngaging storytelling and comedic timing\nAn unforgettable night of laughter\nInteractive audience engagement\nProfessional comedy show experience\n\nVenue Information\nWells Hall at The Parker is a premier entertainment venue in Fort Lauderdale\, offering state-of-the-art sound and lighting systems. Located in the heart of downtown Fort Lauderdale\, the venue provides an intimate setting for comedy performances with excellent sightlines and comfortable seating. \nTicket Information\nTickets are available through Ticketmaster and VividSeats. Prices vary based on seat selection and availability. Purchase your tickets early to secure the best seats for this popular show. \nOfficial Tickets (Ticketmaster) \nResale Tickets (VividSeats) \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change.