SUMMARY:Ron Funches LIVE at The Wilbur
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Performer\nRon Funches is the human embodiment of a warm hug that somehow learned to roast you — with love. A master of joyful\, disarming stand-up comedy\, Ron has built a devoted fanbase through his uniquely positive and hilarious approach to life\, relationships\, and the world around him. \nKnown for his roles on Undateable\, Powerless\, and Trolls\, as well as his many appearances on @midnight and Conan\, Ron brings the same infectious warmth and brilliant comedic timing to his live shows that has made him one of the most beloved performers in comedy today. \nHis stand-up is feel-good\, funny\, and completely original — the kind of comedy that leaves you smiling long after the show is over. Ron Funches at The Wilbur is the perfect summer night out. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Saturday\, July 25\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM ET\nVenue: The Wilbur\, 246 Tremont St\, Boston\, MA 02116\nTickets from: $54\n\nAbout the Venue\nThe Wilbur is one of Boston’s most beloved and intimate comedy venues\, located in the heart of the Theater District at 246 Tremont Street. With a capacity of approximately 1\,000 guests\, The Wilbur offers an up-close and personal experience that perfectly suits Ron’s warm and engaging performance style. \nThe venue features excellent sightlines from every seat\, a full bar\, and a warm\, historic atmosphere that makes every show feel special. Originally built in 1914\, The Wilbur has been lovingly restored and is now one of the premier comedy destinations on the East Coast. \nParking is available at nearby garages in the Theater District\, and the venue is easily accessible via the MBTA Green and Orange Lines at Boylston and Back Bay stations. \nWhat to Expect\nExpect a joyful\, hilarious\, and completely heartwarming evening of stand-up comedy as Ron Funches takes the stage at The Wilbur. This is a solo performance featuring Ron’s signature blend of positive energy\, personal storytelling\, and the kind of disarming humor that makes everyone in the room feel welcome. \nThis show is suitable for audiences of all ages and is perfect for a fun summer night out with friends or family. Come ready to laugh\, feel good\, and leave with a smile on your face. \nTicket Information\nTickets from $54. Purchase official tickets through Ticketmaster or find resale tickets via VividSeats. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/ron-funches-live-at-the-wilbur/
LOCATION:The Wilbur\, 246 Tremont St.\, Boston\, MA\, 2116
