SUMMARY:Adam Ray: WHO IS ME Tour LIVE at Wells Hall at The Parker
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nAdam Ray: WHO IS ME Tour LIVE at Wells Hall at The Parker\nComedian and actor Adam Ray brings his hilarious WHO IS ME Tour to the intimate and acclaimed Wells Hall at The Parker in Fort Lauderdale on Saturday\, July 25\, 2026. Best known for his viral portrayal of Dr. Phil and his roles in major films and TV shows\, Adam Ray delivers a high-energy stand-up experience packed with crowd interaction\, surprise characters\, and non-stop laughs. This is an 18+ event. \nEvent Details\nDate: Saturday\, July 25\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM (Doors open at 6:00 PM)\nVenue: Wells Hall at The Parker (Lillian S. Wells Hall)\nAddress: 707 NE 8th Street\, Fort Lauderdale\, FL 33304\nAge Requirement: 18+ (Adult language and content)\nParking: Complimentary parking available; Valet $10–$15 \nAbout Adam Ray\nAdam Ray is a comedian\, actor\, and podcaster best known for his uncanny impression of Dr. Phil\, which has garnered over 10 million views online. He has appeared in The Barbie Movie\, Curb Your Enthusiasm\, MadTV\, Hacks\, Pam & Tommy\, and The Heat. His live show blends stand-up comedy with wild crowd interactions\, celebrity impressions\, and surprise guest appearances. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHilarious stand-up comedy from one of Hollywood’s most versatile comedians\nAdam Ray’s viral Dr. Phil impression performed live\nWild crowd interactions and audience participation\nSurprise characters and celebrity impressions\nLate-night talk show energy in a live comedy setting\nAdult language and mature content — 18+ only\n\nVenue Information\nWells Hall at The Parker (Lillian S. Wells Hall) is Fort Lauderdale’s premier performing arts venue\, located at 707 NE 8th Street. The Parker offers complimentary parking\, valet services\, premium club experiences (The Haller Club and The Place To Be)\, and excellent sightlines from every seat. \nTicket Information\nTickets start from $51 and are available now through Ticketmaster (official) and VividSeats (resale). This event is part of the Truist Comedy Series. Ticket limit of 8 per person. All-inclusive pricing applies. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
