SUMMARY:Perritos Only Present: That's Not Me Comedy LIVE at The Magnolia
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performers\nConcrete (also known as DoKnow) is a Southern California stand-up powerhouse who blends bilingual storytelling\, quick-fire crowd work\, and a DJ’s sense of rhythm. He first turned heads with viral sketches and on-the-street characters\, then brought that energy to clubs and theaters across the country. \nHis set moves from the comedy of family life to car culture\, from neighborhood nostalgia to sharp observations about identity and hustle — always grounded in heart and razor-sharp timing. Expect punchlines that land fast\, callbacks that sneak up on you\, and an atmosphere that feels like a block party where everyone’s invited. \nJerry Garcia (the comedian\, not the musician) is a rising stand-up star known for his relatable\, high-energy performances. Together\, Concrete and Jerry Garcia form the dynamic duo behind the viral Perritos Only brand — a comedy movement that has taken social media and live stages by storm. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Saturday\, July 25\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM (Doors open approximately 7:00 PM)\nVenue: The Magnolia\, 210 E Main Street\, El Cajon\, CA 92020\nShow Duration: Approximately 2.5 hours\nAge Restriction: 21+ Event\n\nAbout the Venue\nThe Magnolia is one of San Diego’s most beloved mid-size entertainment venues\, located in the heart of downtown El Cajon. With a capacity of approximately 1\,100 guests\, it offers an intimate yet energetic atmosphere that’s perfect for stand-up comedy. \nThe venue features a full bar\, excellent sightlines from every angle\, and a warm\, welcoming vibe that makes every show feel like a special event. The Magnolia is known for its top-notch sound system and attentive staff\, ensuring a premium experience from the moment you walk in. \nParking is available in nearby lots and street parking throughout downtown El Cajon. The venue is easily accessible from the I-8 freeway\, making it a convenient destination for comedy fans from across the greater San Diego area. \nWhat to Expect\nThe Perritos Only: That’s Not Me Comedy Tour is a high-energy\, laugh-out-loud night featuring two of the hottest names in bilingual comedy. Concrete and Jerry Garcia have built a massive following through their viral social media content and now bring that same infectious energy to the live stage. \nExpect a night filled with relatable stories\, crowd interaction\, sharp observational humor\, and the kind of comedy that resonates deeply with Latino audiences and comedy fans of all backgrounds. This is a 21+ event\, so come ready for an adults-only evening of unfiltered laughs. \nThe show is expected to run approximately 2.5 hours\, including an opening set. Arrive early to grab a drink and get settled before the headliners take the stage. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: From $72 (resale) | Official tickets available on Ticketmaster \nSecure your seats now before they sell out — this show is expected to be a hot ticket in San Diego this summer! \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/perritos-only-present-thats-not-me-comedy-live-at-the-magnolia/
LOCATION:The Magnolia\, 210 E Main Street\, El Cajon\, CA\, 92020\, USA
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://comedycalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/2f6ac2cb-18b8-48ec-8250-0e37221f5f91_CUSTOM-TFA7h6.jpg
