SUMMARY:Kathleen Madigan: The Day Drinking Tour LIVE at OLG Stage at Fallsview Casino
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nKathleen Madigan: The Day Drinking Tour LIVE at OLG Stage at Fallsview Casino\nComedy veteran Kathleen Madigan brings her hilarious Day Drinking Tour to the OLG Stage at Fallsview Casino in Niagara Falls. With over 33 years in comedy\, Madigan delivers relatable\, laugh-out-loud humor about life\, family\, and everything in between. \nEvent Details\nDate: Saturday\, July 25\, 2026\nTime: 9:00 PM\nVenue: OLG Stage at Fallsview Casino\nAddress: 6366 Stanley Ave\, Niagara Falls\, ON L2G 3Y5 \nAbout Kathleen Madigan\nKathleen Madigan is one of America’s most beloved stand-up comedians\, with over 33 years of experience and multiple Comedy Central specials. Known for her relatable humor about family\, politics\, and everyday life\, she has toured with Jerry Seinfeld and Lewis Black and continues to sell out venues nationwide. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHilarious observational comedy from a 33-year veteran\nRelatable humor about family\, life\, and everything in between\nA world-class venue experience at Fallsview Casino\nStunning Niagara Falls backdrop\nAn unforgettable night of comedy\n\nVenue Information\nThe OLG Stage at Fallsview Casino is a premier entertainment venue at 6366 Stanley Ave in Niagara Falls\, Ontario. \nTicket Information\nTickets start at $75. Get your seats now! \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you.\nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
